# `.eukoine/` single source

When this repository is a family member, `.eukoine/` is a **synced
mirror** of the hub canonical copy. Read it freely. Cite it by path.
Do not summarise, restate, or re-derive its contents in any other file.

How the spec changes is owned at
[`../eukoine/.eukoine/WRITE_ACCESS.md`](../../../eukoine/.eukoine/WRITE_ACCESS.md)
— cite that path; do not copy it here. Unlock → edit the **hub** → sync
→ lock. A hand-edit of a member mirror is drift.

Coin-time check: `/baptise`. Join in this repo: `PREDICATES.json`.
